kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "output-sink-fastpath"
purpose: "为 sinks 提供可选的 aligned-write fastpath 接口（`write_column_aligned`/`write_row_aligned`），pipeline 优先使用 fastpath 以避免中间 dict 分配，回退兼容现有接口。 [scope-review-2026-07-13-c25-xlsx-ir-path-presence]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[3]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r66,"Optional aligned-write fastpath interfaces","系统 MUST 为 sinks 提供可选的 aligned-write fastpath，以减少执行层在写出前构造中间 `dict` 的分配开销。 系统 MUST 定义以下可选接口（方法名为稳定契约）： - 对 `IColumnSink`：`write_column_aligned(field_key, row_ids, values)` - `row_ids` 与 `values` MUST 为等长序列 - `values[i]` 对应 `row_ids[i]` 的值 - 对 `IRowSink`：`write_row_aligned(field_keys, values)` - `field_keys` 与 `values` MUST 为等长序列 - `values[i]` 对应 `field_keys[i]` 的值"
  r310,Pipeline prefers fastpath when available,"当 sink 支持 aligned-write fastpath 时，pipeline MUST 优先使用 fastpath，并且 MUST 避免构造等价的 `{row_id: value}` / `{field_key: value}` 中间 `dict`。"
  r433,Backwards compatible fallback behavior,"当 sink 未实现 aligned-write fastpath 时，pipeline MUST 回退使用现有接口（`write_column`/`write_row` 等），并保持输出语义一致。"
scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r66,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r66,"aligned-column-write-validates-lengths","",`write_column_aligned` 收到长度不一致的 `row_ids` 与 `values`,"sink 实现 MUST fail-fast 抛出错误并指出不一致",true
  r310,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r310,"column-mode-uses-aligned-write-when-supported","",pipeline 运行在列式 sink 且 sink 支持 `write_column_aligned`,"pipeline MUST 通过 aligned-write 写出列数据",true
  r310,"streaming-row-mode-uses-aligned-write-when-supported","",pipeline 运行在行式流式 sink 且 sink 支持 `write_row_aligned`,"pipeline MUST 通过 aligned-write 写出行数据",true
  r433,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r433,"existing-sinks-still-work-without-fastpath","","用户提供的 sink 仅实现现有接口且不包含 aligned-write 方法",pipeline MUST 仍可运行并产出与 fastpath 语义一致的结果,true